        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894910/extras/00f27c58eb20932cd51c44eff45f96cf.avif?t=1772832286\" width=832 height=430 /></span>A girl who loves fashion and cute things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She spends all her time alone in a small room, unable to go outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She dreams of going outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling sorry for her, you decide to take her outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, she encounters creepy picture books, strange paintings on the walls, and a multi-legged monster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mystery only grows as she progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as we get closer to the outside world, a certain reality becomes apparent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does her happiness lie outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why can't she go outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After knowing all this, will you still take her outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894910/extras/5a14a02a8ee664eeec8e9a98bc83a3d7.avif?t=1772832286\" width=832 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short horror adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to lead the lonely girl to the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are obstacles along the way that will hinder her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, she may even be chased by unidentified monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve these obstacles and bring her out into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Play time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 30 minutes to 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The endings branch out depending on the player's choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move/Select: ↑←↓→</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open menu screen/Cancel: X button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Video submissions and live streaming&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome. No prior notice is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please abide by the following points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Video submissions and streaming that contain content that violates public order and morals or slanders are prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please include the name of the game in the title of your submission or stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please include the URL of this store page in the summary or description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please note that the producers will not be held responsible for any trouble or damage that may occur to the publisher or third parties when posting videos or live streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Disclaimer&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creator is not responsible for any disadvantages arising from this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894910/extras/00f27c58eb20932cd51c44eff45f96cf.avif?t=1772832286\" width=832 height=430 /></span>A girl who loves fashion and cute things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She spends all her time alone in a small room, unable to go outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She dreams of going outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling sorry for her, you decide to take her outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, she encounters creepy picture books, strange paintings on the walls, and a multi-legged monster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mystery only grows as she progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as we get closer to the outside world, a certain reality becomes apparent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does her happiness lie outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why can't she go outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After knowing all this, will you still take her outside?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894910/extras/5a14a02a8ee664eeec8e9a98bc83a3d7.avif?t=1772832286\" width=832 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short horror adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to lead the lonely girl to the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are obstacles along the way that will hinder her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, she may even be chased by unidentified monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve these obstacles and bring her out into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Play time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 30 minutes to 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The endings branch out depending on the player's choices and actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move/Select: ↑←↓→</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open menu screen/Cancel: X button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash: Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Video submissions and live streaming&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome. No prior notice is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please abide by the following points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Video submissions and streaming that contain content that violates public order and morals or slanders are prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please include the name of the game in the title of your submission or stream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please include the URL of this store page in the summary or description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Please note that the producers will not be held responsible for any trouble or damage that may occur to the publisher or third parties when posting videos or live streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Disclaimer&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creator is not responsible for any disadvantages arising from this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "This is a horror adventure game where you guide a lonely girl into the outside world. The girl is stuck in a small room, alone and unable to go outside. She dreams of the outside. What is outside? Why can't she go outside? Even after learning the reason, will you still take her outside?",
